	Just finished unpacking the spoiler files from uunet.uu.net.

	I had FTPed the files (part01.Z to part05.Z) to my Sun account
and used the following command to unpack them.

compress -d "filename"

	Once you do this, edit the files and follow the instructions given
in them.

Note: All this was done on the Sun workstation. I don't think you can do
this in a non-UNIX environment.

	If anyone from the Spoiler team reads this, could you please
include instructions on how to unpack the files, next time?


